      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Stellenbosch, South Africa’s second oldest town, boasts Cape Dutch historic buildings and a vibrant café, restaurant, boutique, and art gallery scene.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
