      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Stellenbosch University, founded in 1863, occupies much of the town centre and is one of South Africa’s oldest universities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stellenbosch",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Within three years of its founding, Stellenbosch became an independent local authority in 1682 and a magistrate seat over 25,000 km² by 1685.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
